" 

https://axion-ia.com

The end-to-end AI partner for SMEs


AUDIT REQUEST RECEIVED

We received your audit request (Audit IA) for 24 salariés company — Industrie sector. Our team gets back to you with a mission calendar.

Hello Camille,
The audit takes 5 to 10 days depending on scope. You'll receive an actionable report with quantified quick-wins and a 90-day action plan.

Reference: demo-0000

Audit methodology  → https://axion-ia.com/en/methodologie

Button not working? Copy this address:
https://axion-ia.com/en/methodologie

A question? Just reply to this email — it reaches us directly, and a human reads it.

Williams Jullin
Founder & CEO · Axion-IA
Hearing about AI everywhere and no longer sure where to start? We cut through the noise, and handle it for you, end to end.
AI audit · Automated systems implementation · Training · 1-to-1 coaching
LinkedIn https://www.linkedin.com/in/williamsjullin/

Axion-IA — LinkedIn https://www.linkedin.com/company/axion-ia-france · Facebook https://www.facebook.com/axioniacom · X https://x.com/AxionIAFrance — Williams Jullin : LinkedIn https://www.linkedin.com/in/williamsjullin/

AXION IA SAS · French company (SAS)
11 Avenue Paul Verlaine, ELITE BUREAUX - boîte 53, 38100 Grenoble, France
Reg. no. 108018631 · VAT FR51108018631 · Training provider reg. no. 84381100438
Cet enregistrement ne vaut pas agrément de l'État.
Contact: contact@axion-ia.com
© 2026 AXION IA SAS — All rights reserved."
`;

